[node name="LoreIntro" parent="." unique_id=1369199900 instance=ExtResource("7_lore")]
story_text = "LEVEL 2: DOWNTOWN, THE NEXT MORNING

Dylan didn't sleep. He followed the smoke and the tire marks all night.

A guy at the hot dog stand says he saw Dylan's car parked downtown this morning, with Tyler sitting on the hood eating a burrito.

The sidewalks are packed with grannies on their morning walk, and someone left the construction site wide open.

Ride the moving platform, stomp the grannies (sorry, grandma), and keep going."

